+{#
+  firewall.zonebased on PAN-OS, as configuration-mode set commands -- same
+  single-transport port as firewall.policy/panos.j2 (see the header there for
+  the reasoning). Default rules first, then explicit rules; declaration order
+  is evaluation order on a fresh device.
